# OFAT sweep split across two GPU boxes (2026-07-09). L2 already complete on newton.
# Split by MANIFEST/QUEUE ORDER so newton (left running the full queue) covers the
# first half as it goes, and luffy takes the second half in parallel. Each config
# only needs one result (from whichever box); newton redoing luffy's tail later is
# harmless waste that can be killed once luffy reports its 6 done. Merge: rsync
# luffy's artifacts/training_runs/ablation_ofat/<name> back to newton for ranking.
#
# newton (RTX 4090) — NOT restarted; runs the full queue in order, first half lands first:
#   L4, L8, L12, L6_H4_E128, L6_H6_E192, L6_H12_E384
#
# luffy (RTX 5090, ~/miniconda3) — SECOND HALF (the queue tail newton reaches last):
LUFFY_RUN_ONLY="L6_H16_E512_ctx128 L6_H4_E256_ctx128 L6_H16_E256_ctx128 L6_H8_E256_ctx32 L6_H8_E256_ctx64 L6_H8_E256_ctx256"
